  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# First Visit\n\n\n\n###### Patient Information\n\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\n\n###### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nWisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nExposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nRemoval Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n\n##### Patient Information\n\n\n\n##### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\n\n###### Patient Information\n\n\n\n###### Post-Op Instructions\n\n\n\n## Welcome!\n\n\nYour initial appointment will consist of a consultation explaining your diagnosis and treatment options. Occasionally for your convenience, a surgery can be performed the same day as the consultation for healthy patients not on blood thinners. This is especially true for healthy patients scheduled to have wisdom teeth removal under general anesthesia. However, for those with a complex medical history, or those who are on blood thinners, a pre-surgical consultation will be required and a second appointment to provide treatment on another day.\n\n\n##### Please assist us by providing the following information at the time of your consultation:\n\n\nYour surgical referral slip (given to you by your dentist or physician).\n\nAny recent x-rays if applicable – If your dentist or physician has taken x-rays you may request that they forward them to our office or you may pick them up and bring them to our office. If additional films are necessary they can be taken at our facility.\n\nCurrent list of medications\n\nIf you have medical and/or dental insurance, please submit them with your online patient registration form or bring your insurance card(s) with you for us to scan. This will allow us to help you process any insurance claims in a timely manner.\n\nIMPORTANT: All patients under the age of 18 MUST be accompanied by a parent or legal guardian.\n\n\n## Surgery Prep\n\n\n\n##### If you are anticipating local anesthesia or nitrous oxide:\n\n\nYou may eat and drink as you normally would. No dietary restrictions.\n\nNo smoking (including recreational drugs as well) for at least 24 hours before surgery. Ideally, cut down on or stop smoking as soon as possible prior to the day of your surgery.\n\nYou may drive yourself to and from your appointment.\n\nIf you have an illness such as a cold, sore throat, stomach or upset bowels, please notify the office.\n\nIf you take routine oral medications, please check with your surgeon prior to your surgical date for instructions.\n\nPlease arrive 15 minutes prior to your appointment.\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
